{"3898070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUSPECTO", "steam_appid": 3898070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/939e96164f35c29d231748e7d9330fa5.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1560 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUSPECTO is a game that features more dynamic gameplay and additional features compared to classic social deduction games. It offers flexible map options playable with few or many people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/df5ac9829c9470800b2cbe22032e9279.poster.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/df5ac9829c9470800b2cbe22032e9279.webm?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/df5ac9829c9470800b2cbe22032e9279.mp4?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔪 KILLER ROLE: Look Innocent, Kill, Escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Killer, your goal is: Complete tasks without getting caught by Agents, find your knife and syringe, kill your targets, and escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> The <strong>Knife</strong> kills instantly but makes noise and can be seen by agents. The <strong>Syringe</strong> kills with a delay, so agents might not see who did it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gas Problem:</strong> Your biggest enemy is your uncontrollable gas. Farting at intervals reveals your location. But if you fart directly at an Agent, you stun them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disguise:</strong> Cornered? Change your disguise immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spawn Clone:</strong> Spotted? Immediately send an innocent clone that looks like you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/7dcb2b6d68c59312103433ae439deb25.poster.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/7dcb2b6d68c59312103433ae439deb25.webm?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/7dcb2b6d68c59312103433ae439deb25.mp4?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕵️‍♂️ AGENT ROLE: Observe, Find, Kill!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Agent, your duty is to stop the killers within the crowd. Get your weapon, observe, and kill!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat Detector:</strong> Cats are your biggest helpers. Find a cat and place it at key points on the map. When a cat sees a killer, it meows to warn you. Follow the sound, find the killer. But beware: if killers fart near the cat, it will get scared and run away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot the Right Person:</strong> You can't shoot every suspect. If you shoot an innocent person, you are eliminated. Listen to the sounds, watch who is leaking gas, and pull the trigger only when you are sure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/080accbb52f44e89624c718b44109935.poster.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/080accbb52f44e89624c718b44109935.webm?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/080accbb52f44e89624c718b44109935.mp4?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌐 GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUSPECTO has flexible gameplay playable with either small or large groups.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Player Count:</strong> Play a <strong>1v1</strong> duel or a <strong>5v5</strong> team match. The game is playable from 2 to 10 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Maps:</strong> Each map contains different hiding spots and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Match is Different:</strong> Target locations, weapon spawns, and player tactics change in every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.poster.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.webm?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.mp4?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/939e96164f35c29d231748e7d9330fa5.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1560 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUSPECTO is a game that 