e gameplay playable with either small or large groups.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Player Count:</strong> Play a <strong>1v1</strong> duel or a <strong>5v5</strong> team match. The game is playable from 2 to 10 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Maps:</strong> Each map contains different hiding spots and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Match is Different:</strong> Target locations, weapon spawns, and player tactics change in every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.poster.avif?t=1769104707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.webm?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/e95f24b8898b37b7de60013a8a452ec2.mp4?t=1769104707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Imagine you're a serial killer with a problem: You can't hold your gas! Agents are armed and have detector cats. SUSPECTO rewrites social deduction with 'some gas' and 'a few cats'. Act like an innocent, fart strategically, and watch out for cats in this 2-10 player chaos!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Indonesian, Polish, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Spanish - Latin America, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Czech, Swedish, Thai, Hindi", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/03c3a46b4e515a77c5c105e4a5155129ae59f16c/header.jpg?t=1769104707", "capsule_image": "https://shared.a